    "abstract": "Illustrated parts breakdown of one inner tank boost pump position, showing the inlet interface hardware, the restrictor, the level sensing item and the local distribution parts.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of one inner tank boost pump position, including the inlet flange interface and the local distribution items. Use it to order pump interface hardware.",
      "figure_note": "The figure shows the left inner tank position looking outboard; the right hand side is a mirror image and the aircraft carries four positions in total. Item 10 is the restrictor at the outboard position and item 10A is the valve kit, listed as its alternate. The flange seal is a single use item supplied with the pump and is not a separate catalogue item."
